# Photoroom

> Photoroom is an AI-powered background remover and image editing platform.  
> It enables users to create professional-quality visuals through AI-assisted tools.  
> It empowers e-commerce businesses and brands to easily create consistent visuals.

1. Photoroom provides a suite of AI-powered image editing tools.
2. Users can remove backgrounds and enhance images.
3. Brands can create visuals and product photography with ease.

